---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Push a kit artifact to an OCI registry

Usage: bento kit push [OPTIONS] <DIRECTORY> <REFERENCE>

Arguments:
  <DIRECTORY>
          Kit directory: spec.yaml and an optional files/

  <REFERENCE>
          Where to push it: registry/repo:tag

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Enable debug logging: each smolvm call, and SMOLBENTO_LOG at info unless set

      --sign
          Sign the pushed kit and attach the signature as an OCI referrer

      --key <KEY>
          Private key for key-based signing (PEM); omit for keyless signing

      --identity-token <IDENTITY_TOKEN>
          OIDC identity token for keyless signing; defaults to the ambient CI provider, then an interactive browser login

      --no-input
          Never prompt; commands that need an answer fail with the command to run instead

      --identity-token-file <IDENTITY_TOKEN_FILE>
          File holding the OIDC identity token; keeps it out of the process arguments

      --tlog-upload[=<TLOG_UPLOAD>]
          Upload the keyless signature to the Rekor transparency log; set false for private kits

          [default: true]
          [possible values: true, false]

  -h, --help
          Print help
